\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Coalition values for the 3-feature game $N' = \{\varname  {gender},\varname  {credit},\varname  {check\text  {-}failed}\}$. Bold \textbf  {NaN} entries flag coalitions whose value function evaluates $\tilde  f$ at the impossible cell $(c{=}1,cf{=}1)$ with positive weight. Plain SHAP and Causal SHAP coincide whenever neither $\varname  {credit}$ nor $\varname  {check\text  {-}failed}$ is dropped, since the only structural coupling in the model is between these two; they diverge whenever one is in $S$ and the other is not.}}{22}{table.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
